            "iterations": 1,
            "keyLength": 64,
            "hashAlgorithm": "SHA-256"
          },
          "note": "# PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA-256\n- Test vector: RFC 7914 section 11 (P=\"passwd\", S=\"salt\", c=1, dkLen=64)\n- `iterations` is 1 only because this is a published vector. Real password hashing needs far more."
